OL,3,GNEWSALicensing policy change could
OL,4,Aphase out strip clubs in Aberdeen
OL,5,
OL,6,FStrip clubs could be phased out in
OL,7,FAberdeen after a policy change was
OL,8,Fagreed by councillors.
OL,10,FThe city has five sexual entertainment
OL,11,Fvenues.
OL,13,FAberdeen City Council's licensing
OL,14,Fcommittee has agreed to adopt a
OL,15,F"presumption against" granting new
OL,16,Flicences, including for any replacement
OL,17,Fof an existing site should it close in
OL,18,Fthe future.
OL,20,FTony Cochrane, who owns Private Eyes in
OL,21,Fthe city centre, said the industry was
OL,22,Fbeing wrongly "targeted".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
